    "created_at": "2016-03-07T15:41:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-07T15:41:48Z",
    "body": "I don't think there's a need for an additional step, as step 7.3 already lets you filter for whatever reason you want. But I'll expand the non-normative note to explain more cases (like timer coalescing) where filtering might be desirable.\n",
